        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/GWxTmSqa1dBt95wflaXRKLMIYwc=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-recipe-63150-chocolate-dipped-apples-step-04-a36661d3ee1d4b979ed90733f459a75d.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/63150/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Dip apples into melted chocolate, turning to coat completely. Dip or roll in candy or nuts, then place on a sheet of waxed paper. Repeat with remaining apples.",
